// DolphinOS Shell 界面：28px 窄顶栏（海豚按钮+时间+状态）+ 板块网格桌面 + 找应用面板 + 系统板块卡。
// Alpha 10 观感重做（用户令「桌面弄成网页一样的」）：配色与用户网站现行
// Dolphin 主题对齐（值在 dolphin-config 调色板）；Dolphin 主题下卡片用
// 自编 squircle 轮廓（Path 点列与网站 clip-path 同一套超椭圆算法，由
// Rust 注入命令串），其余主题用圆角矩形。卡片图标、调序箭头、状态点
// 全部改自绘矢量，不再依赖字体符号字形（防豆腐块，见 ALPHA10-REPORT
// 的字符排查表）。打开动画的放大翻转替身也在本文件（anim-* 属性驱动）。

import { LineEdit, ScrollView } from "std-widgets.slint";

export struct DesktopCard {
    idx: int,
    name: string,
    exec: string,
    section: string,
    frequent: bool,
}

// 五角星（20x20 画布的矢量点列）：常用应用标记，替代 ★ 字符。
component StarIcon inherits Path {
    in property <color> fill-col;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    commands: "M 10 0.5 L 12.9 7.1 L 20 7.6 L 14.5 12.4 L 16.2 19.5 L 10 15.6 L 3.8 19.5 L 5.5 12.4 L 0 7.6 L 7.1 7.1 Z";
    fill: root.fill-col;
}

// 四宫格（2x2 圆角小方块）：非常用应用标记，替代 ▦ 字符。
component GridIcon inherits Rectangle {
    in property <color> fill-col;
    width: 20px;
    height: 20px;
    background: transparent;
    Rectangle { x: 1px; y: 1px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: root.fill-col; }
    Rectangle { x: 11px; y: 1px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: root.fill-col; }
    Rectangle { x: 1px; y: 11px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: root.fill-col; }
    Rectangle { x: 11px; y: 11px; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 2px; background: root.fill-col; }
}

// 调序三角（22x22 画布）：替代 ◀ ▶ 字符。
component TriButton inherits Rectangle {
    in property <bool> left;
    in property <color> fill-col;
    callback clicked();
    width: 22px;
    height: 22px;
    background: transparent;
    Path {
        width: 22px;
        height: 22px;
        commands: root.left ? "M 15 3 L 6 11 L 15 19 Z" : "M 7 3 L 16 11 L 7 19 Z";
        fill: root.fill-col;
    }
    TouchArea { clicked => { root.clicked(); } }
}

component Card inherits Rectangle {
    in property <int> idx;
    in property <string> name;
    in property <string> section;
    in property <bool> frequent;
    in property <length> radius;
    in property <color> card-bg;
    in property <color> border-col;
    in property <color> text-col;
    in property <color> sub-col;
    in property <color> accent-col;
    in property <bool> squircle;
    in property <string> squircle-path;
    in property <float> flip-scale: 1.0;
    callback launch(int);
    callback shift(int, int);

    width: 160px;
    height: 140px;
    background: transparent;

    Rectangle {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: transparent;
        // 翻转/弹入的横向缩放挂在非根元素上（根元素 transform 不生效）
        transform-scale-x: root.flip-scale;

        // 背景层：Dolphin 主题 = squircle 轮廓；其余主题 = 圆角矩形
        if root.squircle: Path {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            commands: root.squircle-path;
            fill: root.card-bg;
            stroke: root.border-col;
            stroke-width: 1px;
        }
        if !root.squircle: Rectangle {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            border-radius: root.radius;
            background: root.card-bg;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: root.border-col;
        }

        VerticalLayout {
            padding: 14px;
            spacing: 6px;

            HorizontalLayout {
                if root.frequent: StarIcon { fill-col: root.accent-col; }
                if !root.frequent: GridIcon { fill-col: root.accent-col; }
                Rectangle {}
                TriButton {
                    left: true;
                    fill-col: root.sub-col;
                    clicked => { root.shift(root.idx, root.idx - 1); }
                }
                TriButton {
                    left: false;
                    fill-col: root.sub-col;
                    clicked => { root.shift(root.idx, root.idx + 1); }
                }
            }

            Text {
                text: root.name;
                color: root.text-col;
                font-size: 17px;
                font-weight: 600;
            }

            Text {
                text: root.section;
                color: root.sub-col;
                font-size: 11px;
            }
        }

        TouchArea {
            y: 46px;
            height: parent.height - 46px;
            clicked => { root.launch(root.idx); }
        }
    }
}

component BarButton inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> label;
    in property <color> text-col;
    in property <color> panel-bg;
    callback clicked();

    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: root.panel-bg;

    Text {
        text: root.label;
        color: root.text-col;
        font-size: 13px;
        horizontal-alignment: center;
        vertical-alignment: center;
    }

    TouchArea { clicked => { root.clicked(); } }
}

export component AppWindow inherits Window {
    in-out property <string> clock: "--:--";
    in property <string> theme-name: "Dolphin";
    in property <color> c-bg: #0f172a;
    in property <color> c-panel: #131f38;
    in property <color> c-card: #1e293b;
    in property <color> c-border: #2e3d59;
    in property <color> c-accent: #6366f1;
    in property <color> c-text: #f8fafc;
    in property <color> c-sub: #94a3b8;
    in property <length> corner-radius: 18px;
    in property <bool> use-squircle: false;
    in property <string> card-path: "";
    in property <string> syscard-path: "";
    in property <[DesktopCard]> cards;
    in property <[DesktopCard]> launcher-cards;
    // 网格列数随窗口宽度自适应（Alpha 10 修复：旧版写死 4 列，大屏上
    // 右侧大片空白、板块不随屏幕调整）：n 列需要 184 + (n-1)*176 px
    // （左边距 24 + 卡宽 160 + 列间距 16，步距 176）。阈值与 logic.rs
    // 的 grid_columns 保持一致；Rust 侧动画几何经 get_grid_cols 取本值，
    // 两处不会漂移。窗口全屏（main.rs set_fullscreen），root.width 即
    // 屏幕可用宽度，改窗口/换分辨率即时重排。
    out property <int> grid-cols: root.width >= 2120px ? 12
        : root.width >= 1944px ? 11
        : root.width >= 1768px ? 10
        : root.width >= 1592px ? 9
        : root.width >= 1416px ? 8
        : root.width >= 1240px ? 7
        : root.width >= 1064px ? 6
        : root.width >= 888px ? 5
        : root.width >= 712px ? 4
        : root.width >= 536px ? 3
        : 2;
    out property <int> grid-rows: Math.max(1, (root.cards.length + root.grid-cols - 1) / root.grid-cols);
    in-out property <bool> launcher-open: false;
    in-out property <string> search-text: "";
    in property <int> flipping-index: -1;
    in property <float> flip-scale: 1.0;
    in property <string> status-text: "";
    // 打开动画替身（放大+翻转）：Rust 定时器逐帧写入几何与翻转量
    in property <bool> anim-active: false;
    in property <length> anim-x: 0px;
    in property <length> anim-y: 0px;
    in property <length> anim-w: 0px;
    in property <length> anim-h: 0px;
    in property <float> anim-scale-x: 1.0;
    in property <float> anim-opacity: 1.0;
    in property <string> anim-name: "";

    callback launch-app(int);
    callback shift-card(int, int);
    callback search-changed(string);
    callback open-settings();
    callback power-off();
    callback reboot();

    title: "DolphinOS Shell";
    preferred-width: 1280px;
    preferred-height: 800px;
    background: root.c-bg;

    // 背景氛围光（向网站默认背景的双色径向渐变看齐的近似：两团低透光晕，
    // 仅 Dolphin 主题显示；Slint 无径向渐变，用大圆低透明度近似）
    if root.use-squircle: Rectangle {
        x: -140px;
        y: -160px;
        width: 520px;
        height: 520px;
        border-radius: 260px;
        background: #6366f1;
        opacity: 0.13;
    }
    if root.use-squircle: Rectangle {
        x: root.width - 380px;
        y: root.height - 360px;
        width: 520px;
        height: 520px;
        border-radius: 260px;
        background: #10b981;
        opacity: 0.09;
    }

    VerticalLayout {
        // ── 28px 窄顶栏：海豚按钮（找应用）+ 时间 + 状态点 ──
        Rectangle {
            height: 28px;
            background: root.c-panel;

            HorizontalLayout {
                padding-left: 8px;
                padding-right: 12px;
                spacing: 10px;

                // 左上角找应用入口（Alpha 10 改定案：海豚图标按钮，
                // 与开机/GRUB 同一套实心海豚素材；点击弹出应用搜索面板）
                Rectangle {
                    width: 64px;
                    background: transparent;
                    Image {
                        source: @image-url("dolphin.png");
                        width: 38px;
                        height: 25px;
                        image-fit: contain;
                        x: 2px;
                        y: 6px;
                    }
                    Text {
                        text: "应用";
                        color: root.c-sub;
                        font-size: 11px;
                        x: 48px;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                    TouchArea {
                        clicked => { root.launcher-open = !root.launcher-open; }
                    }
                }

                Rectangle {}

                // 状态点（自绘圆点，替代 ◉ 字符）
                Rectangle {
                    width: 8px;
                    height: 8px;
                    y: 10px;
                    border-radius: 4px;
                    background: root.c-sub;
                }
                Rectangle {
                    width: 8px;
                    height: 8px;
                    y: 10px;
                    border-radius: 4px;
                    background: root.c-sub;
                }

                Text {
                    text: root.clock;
                    color: root.c-text;
                    font-size: 12px;
                    vertical-alignment: center;
                }
            }

            // 顶栏底部发丝线
            Rectangle {
                y: parent.height - 1px;
                height: 1px;
                background: root.c-border;
            }
        }

        // ── 找应用面板（搜索展开全部应用）──
        if root.launcher-open: Rectangle {
            height: 264px;
            background: root.c-panel;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: root.c-border;

            VerticalLayout {
                padding: 12px;
                spacing: 8px;

                LineEdit {
                    text <=> root.search-text;
                    placeholder-text: "搜索应用…";
                    edited => { root.search-changed(self.text); }
                }

                ScrollView {
                    VerticalLayout {
                        spacing: 2px;
                        for card in root.launcher-cards: Rectangle {
                            height: 34px;
                            border-radius: 8px;
                            background: transparent;
                            HorizontalLayout {
                                padding-left: 8px;
                                spacing: 8px;
                                Text { text: card.name; color: root.c-text; font-size: 13px; vertical-alignment: center; }
                                Text { text: card.section; color: root.c-sub; font-size: 11px; vertical-alignment: center; }
                            }
                            TouchArea { clicked => { root.launch-app(card.idx); } }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        // ── 板块网格桌面 ──
        ScrollView {
            Rectangle {
                height: root.grid-rows * 156px + 190px;
                background: transparent;

                Text {
                    x: 24px;
                    y: 10px;
                    text: "桌面 · 常用应用直接成卡，其余按板块排列（卡片箭头可调顺序，位置会记住）";
                    color: root.c-sub;
                    font-size: 12px;
                }

                for card[i] in root.cards: Card {
                    x: 24px + Math.mod(i, root.grid-cols) * 176px;
                    y: 40px + Math.floor(i / root.grid-cols) * 156px;
                    idx: card.idx;
                    name: card.name;
                    section: card.section;
                    frequent: card.frequent;
                    radius: root.corner-radius;
                    card-bg: root.c-card;
                    border-col: root.c-border;
                    text-col: root.c-text;
                    sub-col: root.c-sub;
                    accent-col: root.c-accent;
                    squircle: root.use-squircle;
                    squircle-path: root.card-path;
                    flip-scale: root.flipping-index == card.idx ? root.flip-scale : 1.0;
                    launch(idx) => { root.launch-app(idx); }
                    shift(from, to) => { root.shift-card(from, to); }
                }

                // ── 系统板块卡：设置 / 关机 / 重启 ──
                Rectangle {
                    x: 24px;
                    y: 56px + root.grid-rows * 156px;
                    width: 688px;
                    height: 120px;
                    background: transparent;

                    if root.use-squircle: Path {
                        width: 100%;
                        height: 100%;
                        commands: root.syscard-path;
                        fill: root.c-card;
                        stroke: root.c-border;
                        stroke-width: 1px;
                    }
                    if !root.use-squircle: Rectangle {
                        width: 100%;
                        height: 100%;
                        border-radius: root.corner-radius;
                        background: root.c-card;
                        border-width: 1px;
                        border-color: root.c-border;
                    }

                    VerticalLayout {
                        padding: 14px;
                        spacing: 10px;
                        Text { text: "系统"; color: root.c-text; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            spacing: 10px;
                            BarButton { label: "设置"; text-col: root.c-text; panel-bg: root.c-panel; clicked => { root.open-settings(); } }
                            BarButton { label: "重启"; text-col: root.c-text; panel-bg: root.c-panel; clicked => { root.reboot(); } }
                            BarButton { label: "关机"; text-col: root.c-text; panel-bg: root.c-panel; clicked => { root.power-off(); } }
                        }
                    }
                }

                if root.status-text != "": Text {
                    x: 24px;
                    y: 186px + root.grid-rows * 156px;
                    text: root.status-text;
                    color: root.c-sub;
                    font-size: 12px;
                }

                // ── 打开动画替身：从卡片几何放大到窗口大小、同时绕竖轴翻转，
                //    后半段淡出把画面交给真实窗口（几何由 Rust 逐帧算好写入）──
                if root.anim-active: Rectangle {
                    x: root.anim-x;
                    y: root.anim-y;
                    width: root.anim-w;
                    height: root.anim-h;
                    background: transparent;
                    opacity: root.anim-opacity;

                    Rectangle {
                        width: 100%;
                        height: 100%;
                        border-radius: root.corner-radius;
                        background: root.c-card;
                        border-width: 1px;
                        border-color: root.c-accent;
                        transform-scale-x: root.anim-scale-x;

                        Text {
                            text: root.anim-name;
                            color: root.c-text;
                            font-size: 20px;
                            font-weight: 600;
                            horizontal-alignment: center;
                            vertical-alignment: center;
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
